Package: LDscnR
Title: Chromosome-wise LD-decay estimation for population genomic data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Petri", "Kemppainen", , "petri@genomeinsights.fi", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Linkage-disequilibrium-aware genome scans. Estimates
    chromosome-wise LD decay, derives a local-LD weight for every marker,
    and turns a per-SNP association scan into LD-supported outlier regions.
    The consistency C-score integrates over the LD window and stringency
    rather than fixing them, markers are clustered into regions by LD, and
    each region is tested at its own locus against surrogate scans that the
    user supplies -- so the method is independent of the association engine
    and of how the null is constructed.
